---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Alex Diaz — E-commerce Tools & Integrations" wide>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Shopify catalog not syncing?<br/>Product feeds breaking silently?</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">I build the tools and integrations that fix that.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="intro">
    <p>
      Years of debugging the places Shopify, Meta, and Google disagree taught me
      where e-commerce data pipelines break. Now I build tools so you don't have to
      figure it out yourself.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="products">
    <h2>Tools & Products</h2>
    <div class="product-grid">
      <a href="https://pipe.snowforge.dev" class="product-card featured">
        <span class="product-badge">SaaS</span>
        <h3>SnowPipe</h3>
        <p>Sync your Shopify or WooCommerce catalog to Google Merchant, Meta, Square, and more. Automated, scheduled, monitored.</p>
        <span class="product-cta">Try free →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/csv-toolkit" class="product-card">
        <span class="product-badge free">Free</span>
        <h3>CSV Toolkit</h3>
        <p>Compare, merge, deduplicate, and transform CSV files. Runs in your browser.</p>
        <span class="product-cta">Use now →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/webhook-inspector" class="product-card">
        <span class="product-badge free">Free</span>
        <h3>Webhook Inspector</h3>
        <p>Capture and debug incoming webhooks in real-time. Built for API development.</p>
        <span class="product-cta">Use now →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools" class="product-card">
        <span class="product-badge soon">Coming Soon</span>
        <h3>MCP Servers</h3>
        <p>Meta Catalog, Shopify Bulk Operations, and Multi-Channel Feed Validator for AI-assisted workflows.</p>
        <span class="product-cta">View all tools →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="links">
    <a href="/portfolio" class="link-card">
      <span class="link-label">Portfolio</span>
      <span class="link-desc">Projects and integrations</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/blog" class="link-card">
      <span class="link-label">Blog</span>
      <span class="link-desc">Shopify, feeds, and debugging</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/services" class="link-card">
      <span class="link-label">Services</span>
      <span class="link-desc">Audits and consulting</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/contact" class="link-card">
      <span class="link-label">Contact</span>
      <span class="link-desc">Get in touch</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .intro {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .intro p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .products {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .products h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .product-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .product-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .product-card:hover {
    background: var(--bg-hover);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .product-card.featured {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }

  .product-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 4px;
    width: fit-content;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .product-badge.free {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .product-badge.soon {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent-dim);
  }

  .product-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .product-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .product-cta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .links {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .link-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .link-card:hover {
    background: var(--bg-hover);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .link-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .link-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }

    .product-grid,
    .links {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
